    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Of the five eggs in Mother Duck’s nest, one is the largest and last to hatch. Bigger and paler than the others, this last hatchling is treated as an outsider by Mother Duck and her ducklings."
