        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Snowed In Comedy Tour is back for its 17th year — Canada’s biggest comedy tour! 70 cities. 4 international comics. Non-stop laughs. Catch Dan Quinn, Paul Myrehaug, Pete Zedlacher, and Erica Sigurdson as they bring a blizzard of comedy coast to coast."
