      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Prince Albert Country Music Association is proud to present an afternoon filled with upbeat music, chosen from many ‘TOP HITS’ and performed by our members. This variety of music from the past to the present is sure to please an audience and bring back many great memories."
