        "@value": "EARC presents An Evening With Brent Butt | EA Rawlinson Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Brent Butt's numerous television specials quickly secured his reputation as one of the funniest people in the country, and it was a TV sitcom penned by Butt called Corner Gas that would be named \"Funniest Show on TV\" by TV Guide readers."
