        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Cupid's Heart | EA Rawlinson Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Cupid’s Heart is a dynamic alt-rock trio from Prince Albert, SK, blending cello, electric guitar, and deep vocals into a gritty, melodic sound. Since debuting in 2022, they’ve earned national airplay, a SaskMusic Award nomination, and a reputation for unforgettable live shows."
      }
