        "@value": "Prince Albert Winter Festival Fiddle Show | EA Rawlinson Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Fiddle has played a substantial roll in the Prince Albert Winter Festival’s 60 year history! The 2024 Fiddle Show, produced by Kerri English, will feature various performers from all over the province!  Brought to you by First Nations University."
