        "@value": "The North Sound | EA Rawlinson Centre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The North Sound, led by Forrest Eaglespeaker and Nevada Freistadt, fuses heartfelt songwriting with modern country and Indigenous storytelling. Rooted in Forrest’s Blackfoot identity, their music offers an honest, genre-pushing sound that has earned multiple awards, and national acclaim."
      }
